      seated.
  - key: Signal
    value: Not a PLC symbol - its Link is disabled. It feeds PartPressDetector locally,
      which publishes the result to the PLC as B_NIO.
  - key: oc.plcPath
    value: MAIN.FG_04.Sensor
  - key: oc.deviceType
    value: SensorBinary
  - key: oc.simulationDevice
