  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Pilar.Context::Pilar.Context.ContextNode
  _entries:
  - key: Function
    value: Gripper on arm 2, the picking arm. Takes the part out of slot 1 and holds
      it until the handover to arm 1.
  - key: oc.plcPath
    value: MAIN.FG_03.Y_Gripper2
  - key: oc.deviceType
    value: Cylinder
  - key: Signal
    value: Double solenoid with both limits read. EXTENDED grips. The limit proves
      the jaws moved, NOT that they caught anything - only B_Detect2 says that.
  _topologySegment: 
  _topologyParent: {fileID: 0}
