--- !u!114 &903228648401145146
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5279911900374761713}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c5236d538fb060b48834286d70f34fa6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PILAR.Context::PILAR.Context.ContextNode
  _entries:
  - key: Function
    value: Payload carrier for arm 2, the picking arm. Holds the part between slot
      1 and the handover.
  - key: Twin
    value: 'OC Gripper on a Rigidbody. The parent Cylinder''s events drive it: OnLimitMax
      calls Pick, OnLimitMin calls Place, and OnActiveChanged calls Place(IsActive).'
  - key: Caution
    value: Cylinder.IsActive means MOVING and Place(true) releases, so ANY drift
      off the max limit drops the payload. A de-energised double solenoid does NOT
      hold it here.
  - key: Approximation
    value: IsPicked is the gripper's own record of what it took, and B_Detect2 reads
      it, so it cannot report a part the gripper has SILENTLY LOST. Real hardware
      would use a beam.
  _topologySegment: 
  _topologyParent: {fileID: 0}
