    - target: {fileID: 5097305092355654368, guid: bb8575989a4a541439d1f6ffd90a3c71, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Four colour signal tower. Samples its red, yellow, blue and green lamps
        into one PLC symbol.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5097305092355654368, guid: bb8575989a4a541439d1f6ffd90a3c71, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: PanelSampler. Aggregates the four tower lamps into one FB_Panel DWORD,
        with the lamps own links disabled. Same packing mechanism as the control
        panel.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5097305092355654368, guid: bb8575989a4a541439d1f6ffd90a3c71, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: 'Verified 2026-08-20 from the live PanelSampler _components list, 4
        bits used of 32: bit0 RED, bit1 YELLOW, bit2 BLUE, bit3 GREEN. Lamps are
        outputs only - the PLC drives them through ControlData; StatusData is unused.
        Order follows the _components list - reordering it changes the PLC bit assignment.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5097305092355654368, guid: bb8575989a4a541439d1f6ffd90a3c71, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[3].value
      value: MAIN.FG_System.H_SignalTower
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
